{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RMRiH8b4rpJHETytuTe5CK","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→# Employee CRUD REST API — AS-IS Spring 4 Legacy Stack\n     2→\n     3→## Overview\n     4→A traditional Spring MVC REST API for employee management.\n     5→This is an **AS-IS legacy project** to be used as migration tool input.\n     6→\n     7→- **Java 1.8** (source/target compatibility 1.8)\n     8→- **Spring Framework 4.3.4.RELEASE** (NOT Spring Boot — uses XML/Java config)\n     9→- **Spring Security 4.2.4.RELEASE** (form-based + basic auth)\n    10→- **MyBatis 3.2.2** (XML mapper files)\n    11→- **PostgreSQL** (JDBC via commons-dbcp2 connection pool)\n    12→- **Maven** build system\n    13→- **Embedded Tomcat 8.5** for integration tests (maven-tomcat7-plugin or embedded server)\n    14→- **JUnit 4** + Mockito for testing\n    15→\n    16→## Functional Requirements\n    17→\n    18→### Entity: Employee\n    19→| Field       | Type      | Constraints                       |\n    20→|-------------|-----------|-----------------------------------|\n    21→| id          | Long      | PK, auto-increment                |\n    22→| name        | String    | NOT NULL, 1–100 chars             |\n    23→| email       | String    | NOT NULL, unique, valid email     |\n    24→| department  | String    | NOT NULL, 1–50 chars              |\n    25→| salary      | BigDecimal| NOT NULL, >= 0                    |\n    26→| hireDate    | Date      | NOT NULL                          |\n    27→| createdAt   | Timestamp | auto-set on insert                |\n    28→| updatedAt   | Timestamp | auto-set on insert/update         |\n    29→\n    30→### REST Endpoints\n    31→| Method | Path                   | Description           | Auth Required |\n    32→|--------|------------------------|-----------------------|---------------|\n    33→| GET    | /api/employees         | List all (paginated)  | USER role     |\n    34→| GET    | /api/employees/{id}    | Get by ID             | USER role     |\n    35→| POST   | /api/employees         | Create new            | ADMIN role    |\n    36→| PUT    | /api/employees/{id}    | Update existing       | ADMIN role    |\n    37→| DELETE | /api/employees/{id}    | Delete                | ADMIN role    |\n    38→| GET    | /api/employees/search  | Search by name/dept   | USER role     |\n    39→\n    40→### Pagination\n    41→- Query params: `page` (0-based), `size` (default 10, max 100)\n    42→- Response wraps list with `totalPages`, `totalElements`, `currentPage`\n    43→\n    44→### Authentication & Authorization\n    45→- Spring Security 4.2.4 with HTTP Basic Auth for API endpoints\n    46→- In-memory user store (for demo purposes):\n    47→  - `admin` / `admin123` → role ADMIN\n    48→  - `user` / `user123` → role USER\n    49→- CSRF disabled for REST API\n    50→- Stateless session (no cookies)\n    51→\n    52→### Error Handling\n    53→- 400 for validation errors (with field-level detail)\n    54→- 404 for not-found\n    55→- 409 for duplicate email\n    56→- 401/403 for auth failures\n    57→- Standard error response: `{ \"status\": 400, \"error\": \"Bad Request\", \"message\": \"...\", \"timestamp\": \"...\" }`\n    58→\n    59→## Architecture\n    60→\n    61→```\n    62→com.example.legacy/\n    63→├── config/\n    64→│   ├── AppConfig.java          # Root Spring config (component scan, property source)\n    65→│   ├── WebConfig.java          # Spring MVC config (message converters, CORS)\n    66→│   ├── SecurityConfig.java     # Spring Security config\n    67→│   ├── DatabaseConfig.java     # DataSource + SqlSessionFactory + Transaction\n    68→│   └── WebInitializer.java     # AbstractAnnotationConfigDispatcherServletInitializer\n    69→├── model/\n    70→│   ├── Employee.java           # Entity POJO\n    71→│   └── PageResult.java         # Pagination wrapper\n    72→├── mapper/\n    73→│   └── EmployeeMapper.java     # MyBatis mapper interface\n    74→├── service/\n    75→│   ├── EmployeeService.java    # Interface\n    76→│   └── EmployeeServiceImpl.java # Implementation\n    77→├── controller/\n    78→│   ├── EmployeeController.java # REST controller\n    79→│   └── GlobalExceptionHandler.java # @ControllerAdvice\n    80→├── dto/\n    81→│   ├── EmployeeRequest.java    # Input DTO with validation\n    82→│   └── ErrorResponse.java      # Error response DTO\n    83→└── validation/\n    84→    └── EmployeeValidator.java  # Manual bean validation (javax.validation)\n    85→```\n    86→\n    87→### MyBatis XML Mappers\n    88→`src/main/resources/mapper/EmployeeMapper.xml` — all SQL in XML:\n    89→- `findAll` with LIMIT/OFFSET\n    90→- `findById`\n    91→- `insert` with `useGeneratedKeys`\n    92→- `update`\n    93→- `delete`\n    94→- `countAll`\n    95→- `searchByNameOrDepartment` with LIKE\n    96→- `findByEmail`\n    97→\n    98→### Configuration Files\n    99→- `src/main/resources/application.properties` — DB connection, MyBatis settings\n   100→- `src/main/resources/schema.sql` — DDL for employees table\n   101→- `src/main/resources/data.sql` — seed data (5 sample employees)\n   102→- `src/main/webapp/WEB-INF/web.xml` — (optional, since using Java config)\n   103→\n   104→## Non-Functional Requirements\n   105→- **Java 1.8 compatible** — no lambdas only if absolutely needed, prefer anonymous classes where possible for legacy feel, but lambdas are OK since Java 8 supports them\n   106→- All dependencies managed in `pom.xml` with explicit versions\n   107→- No Spring Boot auto-configuration — everything manually configured\n   108→- Log with SLF4J + Logback\n   109→- Unit tests with JUnit 4 + Mockito\n   110→- Integration tests using Spring Test with H2 in-memory DB (test profile)\n   111→\n   112→## Testing Requirements\n   113→- `tests/` mapped to `src/test/java/com/example/legacy/`\n   114→- Unit tests for Service layer (mock mapper)\n   115→- Unit tests for Controller layer (MockMvc)\n   116→- Integration tests with Spring TestContext + H2\n   117→- Target: at least 15 test methods across test classes\n   118→\n   119→## Build & Run\n   120→```bash\n   121→# Build\n   122→mvn clean compile\n   123→\n   124→# Test (uses H2 in-memory)\n   125→mvn test\n   126→\n   127→# Package\n   128→mvn clean package\n   129→\n   130→# Run with embedded Tomcat (if configured) or deploy WAR to Tomcat\n   131→mvn tomcat7:run    # or use exec-maven-plugin with embedded server\n   132→```\n   133→"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01XcJCBKsi68fQQZ4rhmBqCD","session_id":"80a1a421-27b4-4bc6-b3a0-5a170dfc59c6","uuid":"42d0252d-645b-4318-8a41-caa038a16984"}
